# Model weights. Every weights file is ignored except the released carrier checkpoints and checkpoints/MANIFEST.json,
# written by tools/export_checkpoints.py --out checkpoints:
#   checkpoints/<population>/seed<s>.pt     recipe R, seeds 0-2 (the 0.1.x configuration, byte-identical to 0.1.x);
#                                           seed[0-5] so that a six-seed recipe-R export is not silently dropped
#   checkpoints/<population>/rw/seed<s>.pt  recipe Rw, seeds 0-5 (the 0.2.0 release configuration)
# one rule per population and folder below (9 populations). Train your own carriers into runs/ (ignored below), not
# checkpoints/: any other weights file under checkpoints/ stays ignored.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
!checkpoints/bdg2/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/goiener_confirm/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/households/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/cambridge/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/heew/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/eweld/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/oslo/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/drammen/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/cineldi/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/bdg2/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/goiener_confirm/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/households/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/cambridge/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/heew/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/eweld/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/oslo/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/drammen/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/cineldi/rw/seed[0-5].pt
!checkpoints/MANIFEST.json

# Raw data, data stores, saved forecasts and arrays are never committed
data/
stores/
*.npz
*.npy
*.parquet
*.feather
*.h5
*.hdf5
*.pkl
*.zip

# Scratch and temporary files (runs/: your own training runs, e.g. the code example of docs/METHOD.md)
runs/
scratch/
tmp/
*.tmp
*.part
*.bak
*.swp
*~

# results/ (scored tables, CSV / JSON / Markdown / log) and figures/ (PDF / PNG and make_figures.py) are tracked.
